                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your patient, a 53-year-old male, admitted on 31/01/2013 with acute right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and low-grade fever, clinically consistent with acute appendicitis. Diagnostic workup included physical examination, blood tests revealing leukocytosis, and abdominal ultrasound confirming appendiceal inflammation. Vital signs were monitored throughout admission. The patient underwent laparoscopic appendectomy on 01/02/2013 without intraoperative complications. Postoperatively, intravenous fluid replacement and analgesic medication were administered. Wound care was provided, and the patient mobilised well with physiotherapy support. He was discharged on 04/02/2013 in good general condition. Please arrange follow-up in approximately two weeks for wound inspection and recovery assessment. Should any concerns arise, do not hesitate to contact our surgical department.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
